{"name":"Kabul","hex":"#6c5e53","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"Kabul","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Proper noun","definitions":["The capital and largest city of Afghanistan.\n\n The Afghanistan government.","The Afghanistan government."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Kabul"}],"entries":[{"title":"Kabul","blocks":[{"text":"Kabul is the capital and largest city of Afghanistan. It is within the jurisdiction of Kabul District and has an estimated population of 5,333,284 people. Located in the eastern half of the country, forming part of the Kabul Province, the city is administratively divided into five zones and 22 municipal districts. The current mayor of the city is Mawlawi Abdul Rashid."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/43/Kabul%2C_Afghanistan_view.jpg/330px-Kabul%2C_Afghanistan_view.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kabul","wikidata":"Q5838"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8c/200229-D-AP390-1529_%2849603221753%29.jpg/500px-200229-D-AP390-1529_%2849603221753%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8c/200229-D-AP390-1529_%2849603221753%29.jpg/1280px-200229-D-AP390-1529_%2849603221753%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8c/200229-D-AP390-1529_%2849603221753%29.jpg/500px-200229-D-AP390-1529_%2849603221753%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3A200229-D-AP390-1529_(49603221753).jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/23/Shah-e-Doshamshera_Mosque_-_panoramio.jpg/500px-Shah-e-Doshamshera_Mosque_-_panoramio.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_conte